gag4(){return"If you share your profile, stop sharing in the app (Share my profile, Stop sharing): the page is erased from the relay as soon as the app reaches it. Without the app, write to contact@mirinu.ch with the link. Otherwise, it is erased 180 days after its last update."},
ag6(a){return"The relay accepts one update per hour: the next one will go at "+a+"."},
